      tell("\"Baxter! Hmmmph. Stuffiest person I ever met! I don't mind telling you I've never liked him much. So serious, businesslike. Thinks he's hot stuff, I imagine. I really shouldn't be telling you this, though, I suppose. \"Rourke,\" they tell me, \"stop your gossiping.\" Not that I'm a gossip, mind you, but I do have my opinions.\"\n");
